Package: whisper-echo
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libsdl2-2.0-0 (>= 2.0.0)
Description: Real-time streaming speech-to-text with Whisper and VAD
 whisper-echo provides a real-time streaming speech-to-text pipeline using
 OpenAI Whisper and voice activity detection. It includes a command-line
 interface and uinput support for keyboard emulation.
